{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國頂級女神孫藝珍與男神玄彬結婚後，順利育有寶貝兒子「小甜豆」，一家三口生活甜蜜爆表！</p><p>夫妻倆私生活向來低調，對兒子的隱私更格外保護，不過孫藝珍10月21日難得在IG曬出親自下廚準備的一桌豐盛家常料理，不僅超強手藝震撼全網，兒子「小甜豆」的稚嫩小手也意外入鏡，萌度破表瞬間炸翻社群！</p><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍（Instagram@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190308165229481984370486.jpeg/45MeQKaNBAeHezFnq1sp8Mug-HnDpGFp34uyHt-Lsh4\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍（Instagram@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><p>韓式烤肉、炒菜色香味俱全！玄彬私下菜單曝光網狂讚：太幸福</p><p>從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理，不僅有紅亮下飯的炒菜、精緻烤肉、蛋料理、豆芽菜以及多款傳統韓式小菜，更搭配生菜與紫米飯，擺盤整齊用心。</p><figure><img alt=\"從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190308467018043392279148.jpeg/KdCS5wJALurvz7fFC-5Vp6a94xyjjLNyOFsoNThbKDU\"/><figcaption>從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190308473028743168314960.jpeg/d0IxdnCsMajSs6JwPSfdb0Ave25Do0G5YMOPdWDDj3U\"/><figcaption>從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190308475910361088219783.jpeg/QIjsPIduyxgEMRxzj4UYQn4n2CLNIZLrz1w_889cP_M\"/><figcaption>從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190308478594846720418932.jpeg/NsAsMfhAWM1HHf-5rX-jnmdLHmI6RZN9fU22-n1Ntvo\"/><figcaption>從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190308451155185664941258.jpeg/39ACDilBo2S8ci4GmSu9oqBUiR2Q4pNfX0gf8l9IH_I\"/><figcaption>從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190308454137466880986370.jpeg/YreH7tSOk9uHjbB0-zcmJ-d2pN9GvXp7JIdXsSSHV7E\"/><figcaption>從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190308457019084800347205.jpeg/tHLXjbG1le0WkN3-H9yV0wgo_dDA6tTNLAkA1SwJANU\"/><figcaption>從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><p>女神的精湛廚藝引發全網熱議，許多網友更笑喊：</p><p>「原來這就是男神玄彬的日常飲食！」</p><p>「菜餚看起來充滿滿滿的愛心，真的太羨慕玄彬了！」</p><p>兒子「小甜豆」萌手搶鏡！孫藝珍甜蜜告白：圍坐用餐是我最快樂時刻</p><p>除了滿桌澎湃佳餚令人食指大動，畫面左下角更意外捕捉到兒子「小甜豆」伸出的稚嫩小手，以及專屬的小筷子與小湯匙，瞬間暴擊無數粉絲的心！</p><p>孫藝珍也在貼文中感性寫道：</p><blockquote><p>每當我忙著做飯，隨後大家圍坐在一起用餐，那便是我最快樂的時刻。希望你們也都身體健康，盡情享受各種美食！</p></blockquote><p>字裡行間流露出對家庭生活的無限珍惜。</p><figure><img alt=\"從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190308470113570816601247.jpeg/j_GNQherOZ00FwvNofew4Y756BtxOvJOYPafdmD2n3Y\"/><figcaption>從孫藝珍曝光的餐桌照可以看到，桌上擺滿各式各樣色香味俱全的家常料理。（Instagram@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍和兒子平時溫馨相處畫面。（IG@yejinfoot_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178292146210476032450172.jpeg/a14ueP3qfKCELWIeEKo9SbiHiY9AL1WSWhqrM1oaqzM\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍和兒子平時溫馨相處畫面。（IG@yejinfoot_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍和兒子平時溫馨相處畫面。（IG@yejinfoot_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178292143874117632364810.jpeg/dIzgcaFAHvTG5xD4GrrtZeueyJcy3hJqdswk_HbMJPw\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍和兒子平時溫馨相處畫面。（IG@yejinfoot_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍和兒子平時溫馨相處畫面。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178293012166348800254610.jpeg/0kv37M2-H3zsI1o4sKGD5ocWF0hGV6bNe556UXueelE\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍和兒子平時溫馨相處畫面。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍和兒子平時溫馨相處畫面。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178292148626526208531682.jpeg/0wHMPG2gTDsCR64zItgvc689H8URDVGeiMLKpojCyqY\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍和兒子平時溫馨相處畫面。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍和兒子平時溫馨相處畫面。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178292150635728896370912.jpeg/dk_N9ONoF6_ssOnFEXKXxrKrz-8cgunRsylsD7MpbA8\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍和兒子平時溫馨相處畫面。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><p>事業家庭完美兼顧！低調放閃閃瞎全網粉絲</p><p>孫藝珍婚後在演藝事業與家庭生活之間取得完美平衡，這次難得公開溫馨的家庭日常細節，也讓廣大粉絲激動留言：</p><p>「桌上的小手指太可愛了！」</p><p>「真的是極度幸福的一家人」</p><p>即使未公開兒子的正面照，充滿愛意的一桌佳餚與小手畫面，仍讓人深刻感受到這對世紀夫妻最平凡卻真摯的幸福。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：孫藝珍曬日本橫濱旅行照被嘲「像大媽」　網民抱不平反擊外貌審判】孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，卻意外引來部分網友挑剔穿搭。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189616400637890560467128.jpeg/tfk7FjL-0Q2s9jGZiRxjL6si4gFwsmN95eF5QuXheUI\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：孫藝珍曬日本橫濱旅行照被嘲「像大媽」　網民抱不平反擊外貌審判】孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，卻意外引來部分網友挑剔穿搭。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，卻意外引來部分網友挑剔穿搭。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189616278432649216807935.jpeg/oDs9_e-FvQ0LNVVVx9rRnaHkQe0rZWaEC0xxrwtMca8\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，卻意外引來部分網友挑剔穿搭。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，網猜測旁邊應是老公玄彬和兒子。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189624088474161152947253.jpeg/sdzXJexHUCEap8jYW-byIM94xLgXx2oU3wwgm98MIJs\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照，網猜測旁邊應是老公玄彬和兒子。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189616280878059520074961.jpeg/uzkArLm7k9EdrmUlSShB4uZtWy83Rl9E8Lvu5vC77uY\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189616283101171712096154.jpeg/XK23B4UsRQHkfeF4-I-t3ojvVMmirx7pvUYddb1GHXU\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189616285311700992182960.jpeg/h4kQHtSA1s_viqtHTux5WilxJD4y7JY-Rk9_lkZPf5Y\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍分享日本橫濱旅行照。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍私服以舒適為主。（IG@yejinfoot_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178292146210476032450172.jpeg/a14ueP3qfKCELWIeEKo9SbiHiY9AL1WSWhqrM1oaqzM\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍私服以舒適為主。（IG@yejinfoot_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍私服以舒適為主。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260920/1178292148626526208531682.jpeg/0wHMPG2gTDsCR64zItgvc689H8URDVGeiMLKpojCyqY\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍私服以舒適為主。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍精緻造型。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189618904180199424154893.jpeg/VyMzwpgfii4Yc_1ciA2b0xW62Y3YHO4XYQn6h2EJ-oc\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍精緻造型。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍精緻造型。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131985518867910656384279.jpeg/0AB1QanWKfi4zTS0W8eO8X_oiXNGqf7xZsDgfGbA4Hw\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍精緻造型。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍依舊具有時尚感。（IG@yejinhand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187757869945196544186539.jpeg/Bx-vOtcL7wpUBgP8IM6--VDko9mK8Ixr_4bFyP-Gxcg\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍依舊具有時尚感。（IG@yejinhand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫藝珍（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230712/755859393597149184268951.jpeg/IgkFHhUYMVA7FqcgYHPjHO0wRNeVO15JifTidYn04nU\"/><figcaption>孫藝珍（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>池昌旭、今田美櫻談跨國戀！《莓好遇見你》5大亮點一次看</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T01:44:53.291937+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1737,"images":26,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:30:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T03:38:21.117642+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T01:39:08.487055+00:00","content_hash":"c4295309416f34feb27ee023554b9de1608a1e0eca3c8f9def524b5950b14ff2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}